    <entry_item>
      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠪᠢᠰᠢᠥ</unicode>
      <uighur>bisiu</uighur>
      <cyrillic>бишүү</cyrillic>
      <transcript>BISIY</transcript>
      <definition>[=bisi + yy] Serves to intensify a preceeding statement, sometimes giving it a shadeof warning: How else!. Surely, certainly.</definition>
      <page>107</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠡᠶᠢᠮᠦ ᠪᠢᠰᠢᠥ</unicode>
          <transcript>eimy --</transcript>
          <definition> Is it not so?.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠡᠷᠡ ᠢᠷᠡᠭᠰᠡᠨ ᠪᠢᠰᠢᠥ</unicode>
          <transcript>tere iregsen --</transcript>
          <definition> He has come (you had better watch out) !.•</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
    </entry_item>
